d like to ask you to illustrate an original character who is active in the PBW \"The Sixth Hunters\".\n\nOutline\nI would like to ask for an illustration of an original character.\n\u3000(The situation, composition, costumes, etc. are all up to you, SATAYAMA-sama.\nThe only thing I would like to specify is that the character should be expressionless.\n\nMy character\nPlease refer to the reference URL for the appearance.\nShe is a girl with a cold and vague atmosphere who does not talk much and has no expression.\nShe is a living dead with amnesia, and has a slightly childish personality.\n\nReference URL\nhttps://tw6.jp/gallery/?id=67528(Full body view)\nhttps://tw6.jp/character/illust?character_id=f23530(Other illustrations)\nhttps://tw6.jp/character/status/f23530(profile)\n\nThe above is all that is required.\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@cherryboy_hip/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2233872, "client_id": 2006575, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a447d9fb/uploads/origins/014f6f4c-257e-414e-b39c-67d6fa3ea712?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3dd18d1528ec62bf6462380dd7966e31", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a447d9fb/uploads/origins/014f6f4c-257e-414e-b39c-67d6fa3ea712?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3dd18d1528ec62bf6462380dd7966e31, https://si.imgix.net/a447d9fb/uploads/origins/014f6f4c-257e-414e-b39c-67d6fa3ea712?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f760e4ba6d3885ec803ff8c1c8d0757 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a447d9fb/uploads/origins/014f6f4c-257e-414e-b39c-67d6fa3ea712?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8255c817e1375e30fbabd0ff9aa6b84 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardc